        ["Note that background downloads may work more reliably if you switch to the \"foreground service\" in the Obtainium settings and/or disable battery optimization for Obtainium in your OS settings."] = "請注意，如果您在 Obtainium 設定中切換為「前景服務」，和／或在作業系統設定中停用 Obtainium 的電池最佳化，背景下載可能會更可靠地運作。",
        ["Note that in the short term, it may continue to be possible to install \"unverified\" (non-compliant) apps through an \"advanced flow\" process that Google has promised to implement after broad backlash to their announcement, but they have not detailed how this would work so it is unclear whether it will truly preserve user freedoms in any practical way.\n\nIn any case, Google's move is a significant step towards the end of free, general-purpose computing for individuals.\n\nNon-certified OSes, like GrapheneOS, should be unaffected by this for as long as they are allowed to continue to exist."] = "請注意，在短期內，可能仍可透過 Google 承諾在其公告遭到廣泛強烈反對後實作的「進階流程」程序，安裝「未經驗證」（不合規）的應用程式，但他們尚未詳細說明此流程將如何運作，因此尚不清楚它是否能以任何實際方式真正保護使用者的自由。\n\n無論如何，Google 的舉動是終結個人自由、通用運算的重要一步。\n\n未經認證的作業系統（例如 GrapheneOS）只要獲准繼續存在，就不應受到影響。",
