        ["Note"] = "Bilješke",
        ["Note that background downloads may work more reliably if you switch to the \"foreground service\" in the Obtainium settings and/or disable battery optimization for Obtainium in your OS settings."] = "Imajte na umu da pozadinska preuzimanja rade bolje ako se aplikacija izuzme iz optimizacije baterije.",
        ["Note that in the short term, it may continue to be possible to install \"unverified\" (non-compliant) apps through an \"advanced flow\" process that Google has promised to implement after broad backlash to their announcement, but they have not detailed how this would work so it is unclear whether it will truly preserve user freedoms in any practical way.\n\nIn any case, Google's move is a significant step towards the end of free, general-purpose computing for individuals.\n\nNon-certified OSes, like GrapheneOS, should be unaffected by this for as long as they are allowed to continue to exist."] = "Imajte na umu da u kratkom roku i dalje može biti moguće instalirati „neverifikovane\" (nesukladne) aplikacije kroz „napredni tok\" koji je Google obećao implementirati nakon široke reakcije javnosti na njihovu najavu, ali nisu detaljno objasnili kako bi to funkcionisalo, pa nije jasno hoće li to stvarno sačuvati slobode korisnika na bilo koji praktičan način.\n\nU svakom slučaju, Googleov potez je značajan korak ka kraju slobodnog, opštenamjenskog računarstva za pojedince.\n\nNecertificirani operativni sistemi, poput GrapheneOS-a, ne bi trebali biti pogođeni ovime dok god im je dozvoljeno da nastave da postoje.",
